+### 3.14 Known contract limitations and lifecycle
+
+- **Roadmap and fidelity activation:** keep generation's positional-input command separate from its legacy multi-spec/template protocol, and keep the directory validator separate from the investigative roadmap/spec auditor. Do not advertise mixed flags or successful validation from exit zero. These are unresolved source-contract gaps, not missing input alone.
